WEBVTT

00:06.650 --> 00:06.690
OZMA

00:06.690 --> 00:06.740
LEIJI MATSUMOTO'S

00:12.660 --> 00:15.620
You looked over the desert wasteland from above

00:15.620 --> 00:18.830
kareki wo sora de mioroshita

00:15.620 --> 00:18.830
and saw dead trees scattered throughout

00:18.830 --> 00:24.500
aoi tori ga nageki naku to

00:18.830 --> 00:24.500
Blue bird, who knows no sadness

00:25.090 --> 00:28.010
machigai darake no kibou no

00:25.090 --> 00:28.010
I ground my teeth, my hope full of misconceptions

00:28.010 --> 00:32.970
okuba de kanda nigai suna hakidasenai

00:28.010 --> 00:32.970
and couldn't spit out the dreadful sand in my mouth

00:32.970 --> 00:38.100
atoaji wa namida he to toketa

00:32.970 --> 00:38.100
Left was only the salt of tears

00:38.100 --> 00:43.520
aisuru mono sae mamorenai okubyou mono ni

00:38.100 --> 00:43.520
For cowards unable to protect the ones they love

00:43.520 --> 00:49.280
michitarita asa wa konai

00:43.520 --> 00:49.280
no future waits past the dawn of day

00:49.650 --> 00:50.450
Woah

00:50.030 --> 00:50.780
oh

00:50.450 --> 00:51.280
oh!

00:50.820 --> 00:55.740
asu no tobira doko he tsuzuitemo

00:50.820 --> 00:55.740
Wherever the door to the future may lead

00:55.740 --> 01:00.960
haruka misueta me wa nidoto sorasanai

00:55.740 --> 01:00.960
I'll stay focused on what I need to do for it myself

01:00.960 --> 01:02.420
Oh,

01:02.040 --> 01:02.830
woah

01:02.380 --> 01:03.290
oh

01:02.830 --> 01:03.630
oh!

01:03.210 --> 01:08.010
itoshiki kimi no kokoro tataku yo

01:03.210 --> 01:08.010
I will take my place in your heart

01:08.010 --> 01:17.270
itsuka tadashii sekai he kimi wo tsureteyuku kara

01:08.010 --> 01:17.270
because one day I will show you the world we should live in

01:31.490 --> 01:35.990
Final Episode: The Day of New Life

01:34.410 --> 01:35.740
It's coming toward us!

01:43.370 --> 01:45.920
Preparations are complete!
Target Ozma!

01:46.170 --> 01:48.800
No, don't hurt Ozma!

01:48.800 --> 01:49.420
Maya...

01:49.630 --> 01:53.640
Ozma is here to make contact with me!

02:07.980 --> 02:09.030
It dived!

02:18.410 --> 02:19.700
You okay, Captain?

02:29.170 --> 02:30.420
Ozma!

02:30.670 --> 02:31.260
Maya!

02:32.050 --> 02:33.420
It's not safe up here!

02:33.420 --> 02:34.630
Come back inside!

02:34.970 --> 02:38.300
Somebody who threatens the Zone is coming!

02:39.010 --> 02:40.810
They're almost here!

02:41.060 --> 02:45.190
If they start their attack,
it'll be too late!

02:49.940 --> 02:51.440
How can we stop them?

02:51.440 --> 02:54.240
There's gotta be something I can do!

02:54.240 --> 02:55.660
Take me to him.

02:56.160 --> 02:59.910
Take me to Ozma.

03:01.620 --> 03:02.540
Got it!

03:02.540 --> 03:03.620
Sam!

03:04.120 --> 03:05.120
Mimay!

03:05.290 --> 03:07.380
Get on, you two!

03:14.090 --> 03:14.880
Bainas!

03:14.880 --> 03:16.260
Sam and the others-

03:16.510 --> 03:17.260
Yeah.

03:19.470 --> 03:23.310
He said Maya could talk with the Ozma.

03:23.310 --> 03:25.270
Let's hope he was right.

03:35.650 --> 03:36.780
Maya!

03:36.780 --> 03:38.030
Get to the front.

03:38.030 --> 03:39.320
Right in front of Ozma's eyes.

03:39.320 --> 03:40.740
I'll try!

03:45.370 --> 03:46.500
Ozma!

03:46.750 --> 03:47.580
Ozma!

03:48.330 --> 03:50.790
Please, calm your anger!

03:51.340 --> 03:52.300
Ozma!

03:55.300 --> 03:56.880
It dove!

03:56.880 --> 03:58.260
Toward that rock!

03:58.930 --> 04:00.050
Got it!

04:11.020 --> 04:12.020
Maya.

04:50.520 --> 04:51.350
Ozma.

04:52.400 --> 04:53.520
It's okay.

04:54.400 --> 04:56.940
You don't have to worry about a thing.

04:59.150 --> 05:00.110
Please,

05:01.240 --> 05:01.990
Ozma.

05:02.870 --> 05:04.280
Let me inside.

05:09.910 --> 05:10.750
Ozma.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.340
M-Maya...

05:38.900 --> 05:39.940
Maya!

05:53.420 --> 05:55.420
They got eaten!

05:56.590 --> 05:58.920
They've disappeared from the radar!

05:59.960 --> 06:02.300
What just happened?

06:02.300 --> 06:03.760
Where are they?

06:03.760 --> 06:04.760
Bainas!

06:35.670 --> 06:37.250
The hell was that?

06:39.050 --> 06:40.000
Mimay!

06:41.710 --> 06:44.050
Hey, you all right? Mimay!

06:46.340 --> 06:47.720
Sam...

06:48.220 --> 06:49.180
Where are we?

06:50.850 --> 06:52.060
No idea.

06:52.060 --> 06:56.350
Looks like the whole place is covered in machines.

06:58.810 --> 06:59.610
Maya.

06:59.610 --> 07:00.780
Where's Maya?

07:01.480 --> 07:02.740
Sam, over there!

07:05.660 --> 07:06.570
That's...

07:07.320 --> 07:08.240
Let's go!

07:13.540 --> 07:14.500
Ozma.

07:14.870 --> 07:16.250
It's you, isn't it?

07:16.870 --> 07:19.920
You've answered my call, haven't you?

07:24.670 --> 07:27.010
Yes, let us.

07:27.590 --> 07:30.890
The future we must choose is clear.

07:30.890 --> 07:32.260
Maya!

07:32.720 --> 07:34.180
You okay?

07:34.600 --> 07:36.600
Sam. Mimay.

07:37.020 --> 07:38.060
Maya!

07:39.060 --> 07:39.980
What is this?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.270
Ozma.

07:42.110 --> 07:44.490
It's waiting for me to decide.

07:45.650 --> 07:46.610
Ozma is?

07:47.990 --> 07:55.370
Ozma has gathered all forms of life
on this planet for centuries,

07:55.660 --> 07:57.750
while awaiting my decision.

07:58.750 --> 08:00.380
Your decision?

08:02.170 --> 08:03.340
Yes.

08:03.880 --> 08:07.510
Centuries ago,
humanity created the Ideal Children,

08:07.510 --> 08:10.890
humans possessed with
superior genetic information.

08:11.390 --> 08:17.390
This resulted in an ecosystem
with the Ideal Children at the top.

08:24.230 --> 08:25.480
But ultimately,

08:25.690 --> 08:30.740
this did not lead to the bright future
for which they hoped.

08:32.490 --> 08:37.330
The Ideal Children are weakening as a species,

08:37.330 --> 08:39.000
and face extinction.

08:41.960 --> 08:48.010
Should we maintain this fragile ecosystem
with humanity at the top?

08:48.760 --> 08:51.510
Or should we release the life

08:51.510 --> 08:57.560
that Ozma has gathered and raised here
in the Zone across the entire planet,

08:57.560 --> 09:01.520
creating a new ecosystem
adapted to the environment?

09:02.020 --> 09:05.070
I must choose the future of this planet.

09:06.940 --> 09:08.530
I wasn't sure what to do.

09:09.240 --> 09:13.490
Would humanity have a
place in this new ecosystem?

09:15.120 --> 09:18.500
But I realized, watching you...

09:19.210 --> 09:23.080
Humanity is more than just the Ideal Children.

09:25.000 --> 09:30.010
By witnessing your strength,
I was able to come to a decision.

09:30.010 --> 09:31.380
Maya...

09:35.430 --> 09:37.220
I must go now.

09:37.890 --> 09:41.140
I must release the life that Ozma has gathered

09:41.810 --> 09:46.650
and raised here in the Zone across the planet.

09:47.610 --> 09:49.780
I am the key for this to happen.

09:51.740 --> 09:53.780
Wait, Maya!

10:04.330 --> 10:05.170
Maya!

10:14.800 --> 10:16.010
Maya!

10:23.270 --> 10:25.230
Sam! Mimay!

10:25.810 --> 10:29.110
Thank you for bringing me this far.

10:29.110 --> 10:32.860
I will now become one with Ozma.

10:33.400 --> 10:34.570
Maya...

10:34.570 --> 10:35.870
Maya?

10:36.660 --> 10:42.830
Please keep living on this planet
with all your strength.

10:45.500 --> 10:47.380
Don't go, Maya!

10:54.470 --> 10:55.630
Maya!

10:56.010 --> 10:56.760
Sam!

11:07.480 --> 11:08.520
Maya!

11:34.800 --> 11:36.050
Directly under us!

11:36.050 --> 11:37.680
There's a large space.

11:37.840 --> 11:40.930
That's where the strong EM waves are coming from.

11:41.260 --> 11:42.680
Did we find her?

11:42.680 --> 11:45.100
Launch all the special depth charges!

11:45.560 --> 11:46.890
General, Miss Maya is...

11:46.890 --> 11:47.940
I said do it!

11:48.190 --> 11:50.690
Setting charge activation depth: 140.

11:50.690 --> 11:52.940
150. 160.

11:53.570 --> 11:54.320
Fire!

11:58.320 --> 12:01.580
Depth charges approaching the QTF!

12:01.740 --> 12:02.660
What?

12:02.660 --> 12:03.450
Can we intercept?

12:03.740 --> 12:04.790
No!

12:06.330 --> 12:07.250
What do we do?

12:07.710 --> 12:09.000
Captain!

12:29.560 --> 12:32.610
What the hell're they thinking?

12:33.070 --> 12:35.610
They're gonna blow up the whole place,
and take Ozma with it!

13:10.060 --> 13:13.480
Miss Maya, my most sincere apologies.

13:13.480 --> 13:16.610
No matter what choice you made,

13:16.610 --> 13:19.280
it will never come to pass.

13:20.280 --> 13:22.990
Because there is only one future:

13:23.700 --> 13:28.040
Eternal rule by the Ideal Children.

13:28.040 --> 13:30.790
If that's not possible,

13:30.790 --> 13:34.420
an honorable death would be better.

13:44.470 --> 13:46.560
Ozma's pissed off!

13:55.440 --> 13:56.320
What happened?

13:56.480 --> 13:58.190
It's from the space below!

13:58.190 --> 14:00.570
The attacks are too fast to predict!

14:02.200 --> 14:03.320
Damn you, Ozma!

14:17.130 --> 14:20.590
At this rate, the whole Zone will collapse!

14:20.590 --> 14:22.090
We need to stop Ozma!

14:22.090 --> 14:22.840
Bainas!

14:41.900 --> 14:42.950
Captain!

14:43.280 --> 14:44.950
Monokeros, fire!

14:49.830 --> 14:51.370
It's not working!

14:51.370 --> 14:52.960
It won't operate!

14:52.960 --> 14:55.920
It's probably locked to the owner's genetic code!

14:56.250 --> 14:58.290
So only Dick can fire it?

14:58.290 --> 14:58.960
What?

14:58.960 --> 15:01.340
Damn it! Can't we do anything?

15:01.550 --> 15:05.800
Someone could get inside that thing
and bust up the reader!

15:07.390 --> 15:08.220
Bainas!

15:16.900 --> 15:18.400
Ship #3 is down!

15:19.690 --> 15:21.440
We must pull back for now!

15:21.730 --> 15:23.190
Surface!

15:31.370 --> 15:32.200
Who's there?

15:38.500 --> 15:39.460
You!

15:48.930 --> 15:51.010
Are you... Gido?

15:52.390 --> 15:53.270
Or...

16:05.400 --> 16:07.200
Just wait for me, Bainas!

16:07.200 --> 16:09.780
I'll find Ozma for sure!

16:10.950 --> 16:13.790
We're gonna change the world!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.250
Dick...

16:20.460 --> 16:21.460
Dick!

16:25.260 --> 16:26.970
Please! Open the door!

16:27.170 --> 16:28.380
Dick!

16:29.930 --> 16:31.470
I'm sorry, Bainas.

16:32.890 --> 16:37.350
Another heart was planted inside me.

16:38.560 --> 16:41.770
It may awaken again.

16:44.110 --> 16:46.860
I've waited for you...
All this time...

16:48.400 --> 16:50.490
I believed we could meet again...

16:51.450 --> 16:52.450
This whole time...

16:54.490 --> 16:55.490
Bainas,

16:57.120 --> 17:01.250
I'm glad I was able to see you one last time.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.170
Wait, Dick!

17:05.630 --> 17:06.420
Dick!

17:14.970 --> 17:15.930
Dick!

17:15.930 --> 17:18.390
Come back, Dick!

17:19.850 --> 17:22.400
Farewell, Bainas.

17:22.600 --> 17:24.150
Dick!

18:04.770 --> 18:05.480
What's happening?

18:05.900 --> 18:07.480
Powerful EM waves!

18:07.480 --> 18:08.860
The helm isn't responding!

18:08.860 --> 18:10.650
What? How could-

19:21.100 --> 19:25.520
A truly chosen being

19:26.600 --> 19:29.860
would be blessed by the sun...

19:31.190 --> 19:36.150
So I guess I'm not one.

19:42.620 --> 19:43.750
It's so bright...

19:45.160 --> 19:49.000
The sun fills the whole sky...

20:22.240 --> 20:27.830
The highest form of life
on this planet is not humanity.

20:28.250 --> 20:31.420
The creatures released from the Zone

20:32.210 --> 20:34.420
will spread over the whole world,

20:34.420 --> 20:36.630
and will one day develop a new ecosystem.

20:52.270 --> 20:55.280
However, humans are not gods.

20:55.280 --> 20:58.990
They are not capable of judging

20:58.990 --> 21:01.910
which life is good and which is bad.

21:03.160 --> 21:06.910
It will not be humanity who
chooses the future of the planet,

21:06.910 --> 21:11.250
but nature, leading the planet to humanity.

21:17.880 --> 21:20.510
Live, and love each other.

21:21.220 --> 21:23.510
That is all humanity can do.

21:38.900 --> 21:39.990
Sam.

21:39.990 --> 21:40.950
Mimay.

21:41.530 --> 21:46.790
I'm sure you will be able to live with strength.

21:48.330 --> 21:49.330
Forever...

21:50.160 --> 21:51.080
And ever...

21:55.210 --> 21:56.040
Sam!

21:56.670 --> 21:58.380
Let's go, Mimay!

21:58.380 --> 21:59.300
Yeah!
